    "ruleCards": [
      {
        "title": "Inventions",
        "content": "Electro Grenade, Self Defense Grid and Smoke Bomb are inventions (purple strip at the bottom). After you play an invention, resolve it as normal, then tuck it under Donatello's hero card instead of discarding it. While tucked, the effect on its purple strip stays active for the rest of the game. In Unbrewed, leave the card on the table next to the hero card."
      }
